<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Rucha Lange is an authentic Indian vocalist who captivates audiences with her exquisite interpretations of both modern and classical songs. Born into a musical family, she grew up listening to her Grandmother Smt. Malti Lange, a renowned singer in Gujarat and studied under the master Guru Shri Aniket Khandekar. She is known for her unique renditions of Indian classical ragas, film songs, ghazals, and devotional music. Rucha's unique vocals can be heard on the ABC Show Wakefield and in the 2015 movie "un-Indian" starring cricketing icon Brett Lee.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
