211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Vikas Kolar is a multi-award-winning singer from Bangalore, Karnataka. Trained in both Carnatic and Hindustani styles, Vikas brings his classical expertise to create a unique and authentic Bollywood style. While in India, Vikas has won several music contests at state and national level and performed for All India Radio. His voice can be heard in many professional recordings and radio jingles for the Kannada-language music industry. In 2018, Vikas received the coveted Musicfare Award, a nation-wide singing contest run by Heart & Soul productions, from world-renowned lyricist Gulzar. He was also judged as the best singer at the South Asian Film Festival in Sydney. Currently, Vikas is a sought-after singer who performs in shows across Sydney with many different bands.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
