/E (Avijit Sarkar is a multi-instrumentalist, composer, illustrator, cartoonist, writer, poet, puppeteer, philanthropist, and mathematician. With over 45 years on stage, he has entertained audiences in diverse musical styles in over 1,800 concerts. Proceeds from his numerous concerts go towards medical research and charity. In 2020, Avijit received the Australia Day Award for contributions to Art and Culture and was featured in the book "Success Stories of Indo-Australians" in 2021. Avijit is the director of Natraj Academy Sydney, where he trains and supports emerging music talent in fine Indian Arts.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
