<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A generational talent, Ruhani Dhillon is a singer, percussionist, guitarist, and dancer whose passion has seen her perform in concerts for international artists like Arijit Singh, Shreya Ghoshal, Atif Aslam and Jubin Nautiyal. Winner of the 2016 and 2018 NSW Percussion Championships, Ruhani has been an instrumental member of several orchestras and percussion ensembles including the Sydney Youth Orchestra, Northern Sydney Youth Orchestra and Drumfill. Ruhani is currently pursuing a Bachelor's Degree in Classical Percussion at the Sydney Conservatorium of Music. Her joyful style and infectious smile has touched hearts across the world via her social media platforms, and her energetic Bollywood numbers continue to rock stages across Australia. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
