/S /P
/E (Niharika Sanghi has trained in Kathak for over 20 years, primarily under the guidance of her Guru and mother Ruchi Sanghi  as well as renowned Kathak Gurus in India such as Smt. Nutan Patwardhan. Niharika has been part of many performances, her latest being the lead in "Anarkali The Musical", a dance production by Ruchi Sanghi Dance Company. She is also one of the main faculty members at RSDC where she trains the upcoming generation of dancers, as well as assists in choreography with a focus on powerful, cutting edge Kathak.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Ruchi Sanghi Dance Company, Australia's most esteemed Kathak dance institution founded by Ruchi Sanghi in Sydney in 2000, has surpassed two decades as a cultural beacon. As well as focusing on world-class Kathak training, RSDC also stage sold-out productions such as "Anarkali The Musical" and "Devdas The Musical." They have also showcased their artistry at high-profile venues such as the Sydney Opera House during the Confluence festival and Prime Minister Modi's reception, and performing at numerous prestigious gatherings, thereby elevating the presence of Kathak on the global stage and strengthening the ties of young Indian Australians to their rich cultural heritage.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
